## 2. Phase 0 — Scope & Rules of Engagement (15 min)

Confirm before touching anything:

- [ ] Written authorization covers: Power BI Service + Report Server (if present) + gateway hosts + file shares
- [ ] **Explicit approval** before any *outward-facing* action: creating a publish-to-web link, sending a share link to any recipient (especially external), creating subscriptions
- [ ] Two test accounts if available (User A = over-privileged, User B = restricted viewer) — cross-user proof needs them
- [ ] Environment identified: S1–S6 surfaces present? (Answer after Phase 1.)
- [ ] Evidence folder created; tokens redacted in all notes (`eyJhbGciOi…<SNIP>`)

**Stop conditions**: tenant-wide changes, modifying datasets/reports of others without approval, disabling anything.

