## 10. Evidence & Logging Standards

Every test gets one row: `ID | phase | test | exact command/action | HTTP status | observed result | screenshot/log file | pass/fail/inconclusive`.
- Screenshot every browser finding (full URL bar visible).
- Save every API response to a JSON file (the runbook scripts already do).
- **Redact all tokens** in notes: `eyJhbGciOi…<SNIP>`. Never paste full tokens into shared documents.
- Delete every artifact you created (share links, PTW embeds, test reports, subscriptions) and record the deletion.

